  "title": "Reserve Pararescuemen Assist with Hurricane Harvey Relief Efforts",
  "description": "Air Force Reserve pararescuemen with the 920th Rescue Wing hoist a civilian in distress from Hurricane Harvey onto an HH-60 Pave Hawk helicopter Aug. 29, 2017 outside of Houston, Texas. The wing deployed more than 90 Air Force Reservists, three HH-60 Pave Hawks and two HC-130Ns to College Station, Texas, in support of Air Force Northern's search and rescue mission for FEMA disaster relief. The 920th RQW is located at Patrick Air Force Base, Florida.",
